      <activity id="9d9a9ef0-9a89-59f5-a065-ca931155a58b" activityNameId="5f215c10-ac61-5959-bc38-4fb3d732d944" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="1">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas service station</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas service station
This data set includes land use for a natural gas service station as well as steel requirements for compressor and container. Data stems from a service station with 310'000 m3 gas (236'000 kg) sold per year (in 365 days). It is assumed that steel and concrete are recycled. A life span of 50 years is assumed.;
UUID: 3fad1514-463b-3774-80b0-32ba7c434957
This data set includes land use for a natural gas service station as well as steel and concrete requirements for compressor and container.
Location: Data for Switzerland
Technology: Service station with steel compressor. 
Time period: personal communication
Production volume: 310'000 m3/a resp. 236'000 kg/a
Sampling: data for one service station 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3fad1514-463b-3774-80b0-32ba7c434957.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
